  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">River restoration perspectives in the Indian Sundarbans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is phase 1 of &apos;River restoration perspectives in the Indian Sundarbans&apos;.The goal is to get a good overview and collection of basic background information of the upper part of the Sundarban delta, needed for the development of a masterplan for the Sundarban delta. This includes the identification of old river channels, their function in this existing channel network, the potential for rejuvenation under present-day conditions and benefits under present-day conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
